{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 8, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese society.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo. The bustling atmosphere and incredible array of fresh seafood on display was a feast for the senses. I was also able to witness the famous tuna auction, a thrilling and chaotic experience that left me energized and inspired.\n\nIn addition to the market, I spent several days exploring the city's many temples and gardens, including the serene Meiji Shrine and the beautiful Shinjuku Gyoen National Garden. The tranquility and beauty of these spaces provided a welcome respite from the hustle and bustle of city life.\n\nAs I traveled throughout the country, I was struck by the kindness and hospitality of the Japanese people. Everywhere I went, I was greeted with a smile and a bow, and I felt welcomed and at home. From the delicious food to the stunning landscapes, Japan has left a lasting impression on me, and I can't wait to return. Whether you're a foodie, a history buff, or simply looking for a new adventure, Japan is a destination that has something for everyone.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.4636104702949524}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.004141089040786028}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -6.9141146923357155e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -8.22540732769994e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.2036478966474533}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.6107152104377747}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.0003526780928950757}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.0003357561945449561}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0001684285